{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Magic Bean</strong></h2>This is the ultimate test of skill and determination : \ud83e\uded8<strong>Magic Bean</strong>\ud83c\udf43 , an intense platformer\u2755<br><br>Each level is designed to push the limits of your abilities, with precision timing and quick <br>reflexes required to overcome the obstacles in your path. With mind-bending level design, and increasing difficulty, <br>Magic Bean will keep you on the edge of your seat as you strive to reach new heights. <br><br>This game is only for the players looking for a real chalenge, it's super hard and there is no mercy\u2755\u2694\ufe0f\ud83d\udc80<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Climbing</strong></h2><br>In Magic Bean you have to jump from platform to platform to reach the next stage, but be careful: if you fall you have to start again, so don't confuse speed with precipitation !<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2346980/extras/MagicBean_Climbing.gif?t=1698426161\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Upgrade</strong></h2><br>You can unlock teleporters, buy tools, improve them and improve your character.<br>Choose wisely, because your choices can greatly influence your success.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2346980/extras/MagicBean_Upgrade.gif?t=1698426161\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Tools</strong></h2><br>There are tools that are like skills that can be unlocked and can be a great help in your climb.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2346980/extras/MagicBean_Tool.gif?t=1698426161\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Hard Challenge</strong></h2><strong>Good luck, you will need it</strong>\u2757","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Easy peasy lemon squezy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2346980/4a92fc96feb08fffcd5f2867f